</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">👇皮肤骗氪池，买皮抽个保底即可，天子有用但不急<br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><section class=\"upload-img-wrapper upload-8437895289793869\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2022/11/9/281586.png\" alt=\"\"></section><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><section class=\"upload-img-wrapper upload-7952003959668099\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2022/11/9/471182.png\" alt=\"\"></section><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">👇2个RB宝石<span style=\"\">池，只出列表的的，上不封顶</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\">都属于现阶段必备的天子，新手无视，尤娜那个池可以碰碰运气，蛮香的</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><section class=\"upload-img-wrapper upload-5410433721910137\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2022/11/9/758639.png\" alt=\"\"></section><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><section class=\"upload-img-wrapper upload-1470973900628445\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2022/11/9/39390.png\" alt=\"\"></section><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">👇木属性血石宇宙池，不要不要不要抽</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2022/10/10/823878.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2022/10/10/823878.png\" style=\"width: 333px; height: 159px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">👇15号出现的活动中期发带池，上不封顶</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">发带池容易抽退坑，这期质量一般并不推荐去抽</div><div class=\"div-img\">根据个人钻石数量来算8W抽不满4只就及时退出止损，3缺1抽到破产比比皆是</div><div class=\"div-img\"><section class=\"upload-img-wrapper upload-92405418205425\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2022/11/9/570729.png\" alt=\"\"></section><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">👇木属性宇宙池，上不封顶，别抽</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"628\" data-height=\"300\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2022/10/10/252749.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2022/10/10/252749.png\" style=\"width: 333px; height: 159px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">👇</span>木属性魂卡，宝石池，可以碰碰运气</div><div class=\"div-img\"><section class=\"upload-img-wrapper upload-8125628853318678\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2022/11/9/719201.png\" alt=\"\"></section><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><section class=\"upload-img-wrapper upload-8125628853318678\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><section class=\"upload-img-wrapper upload-7687305956725143\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_628/h_300/1069/107851/2022/11/9/488466.png\" alt=\"\"></section><br></section></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 107851, "username": "xyzpace", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/18.png", "description": "萌新之友，已重开，真萌新", "follow_num": 1413, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "夏日蓝调", "tag_color": "#00B0F0"}, "role_id": 1, "is_sup